Transly speech packs

The model files in the releases of this repository are modified versions of
the IndicConformer speech recognition models by AI4Bharat:

  IndicConformer (indicconformer_stt_<lang>_hybrid_rnnt_large)
  Copyright (c) 2024 AI4Bhārat
  MIT License (see LICENSE)
  https://github.com/AI4Bharat/IndicConformerASR

Changes made for Transly:

- Kept the CTC decoder only, with the 256 tokens of one language plus the
  blank token. The original model gives the same outputs when it decodes
  with language_id set to that language.
- Exported the model to ONNX (opset 17) and added the metadata that the
  sherpa-onnx NeMo CTC loader reads.
- Quantized the MatMul weights to int8 (dynamic, per channel) with ONNX
  Runtime. The convolution weights stay in float.

The modified files are distributed under the same MIT License.
